flowchart TD
    A[Input file] --> B[Structure check: required columns]
    B --> C[Data checks: blanks, types, ranges]
    C --> D[Transformation: filter or change]
    D --> E[Intermediate check: row count and selected IDs]
    E --> F[Calculation or code behavior]
    F --> G[Automated tests of rules]
    G --> H[Direct evidence: inspect output]
    H --> I[Defensible result]